# Try the API from VS Code (REST Client) or Rider. Run it first with:
#   dotnet run --project src/WindfallSuppers.Api --urls http://localhost:5199
@base = http://localhost:5199

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Host offers a supper
POST {{base}}/suppers
X-User-Id: host-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Squash soup and bread", "area": "Hove", "startsAtUtc": "2027-01-10T18:30:00Z", "seats": 4 }

### Upcoming suppers in Hove
GET {{base}}/suppers?area=hove

### Guest books two seats (paste the id from the create response)
@supperId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{base}}/suppers/{{supperId}}/bookings
X-User-Id: guest-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seats": 2 }

### Guest cancels
DELETE {{base}}/suppers/{{supperId}}/bookings/mine
X-User-Id: guest-1
